/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>.</p><p>Increased chance of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> surge afterwards.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><b>Wild Magic</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Unruly magic sparks and fizzes through your veins.</p><p>Each time you cast a spell of Level 1 or higher, your magic might surge and trigger a <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(sorcerer_subclass)#Wild_Magic_Surge_effects\" title=\"Wild Magic (sorcerer subclass)\">random magical effect</a>.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_GLO_Hirelings_Sorcerer</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Hirelings_Sorcerer+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Hirelings_Sorcerer+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>097aa418-eda5-47f9-867f-29a4339be03e</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:097aa418-eda5-47f9-867f-29a4339be03e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:097aa418-eda5-47f9-867f-29a4339be03e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HeroHalfElfMale</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroHalfElfMale+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroHalfElfMale+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Variant 1</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Hirelings_Stats_Player_Sorcerer</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Sorcerer+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Sorcerer+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>1215e534-4fe5-4ea1-a449-8f2307e1939c</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1215e534-4fe5-4ea1-a449-8f2307e1939c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1215e534-4fe5-4ea1-a449-8f2307e1939c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HeroHalfElfMale</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroHalfElfMale+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroHalfElfMale+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></section></aside>\n<b>Jacelyn</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/High_Half-Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Half-Elf\">High Half-Elven</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> with the <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Bloodline\" title=\"Draconic Bloodline\">Draconic Bloodline</a> subclass.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> As a <a href=\"/wiki/Hirelings\" title=\"Hirelings\">hireling</a>, he can be recruited at camp and respecced at any time.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Backstory\">Backstory</span></h2>\n<p>Jacelyn was born a sorcerer, the seventh son of a seventh son. The agent of the Absolute that killed him knew this, and is rumored to have remarked, <i>\"Probably should've left it at six.\"</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Outsourcing</dt>\n<dd>Recruit a hireling. You can befriend them or use them as cannon-fodder - we won't judge.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Prior to Patch 8 his default subclass was <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(Sorcerer_subclass)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild Magic (Sorcerer subclass)\">Wild Magic</a>. His backstory is one of many references to Terry Pratchett and his Discworld novels, specifically in reference to the novel Sorcery in which a Sourcerer is defined as being the eighth son of an eighth son of an eighth son, \"a Wizard squared.\" </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizo